## Article 361. Grounds for review for newly discovered or exceptional circumstances

```catala
declaration scope Article361ReviewGrounds:
  input check content ReviewGroundsCheck
  output reviewGroundExists content YesNo
  output newlyDiscoveredGroundExists content YesNo
  output exceptionalGroundExists content YesNo
  output reviewNotAllowed content YesNo

scope Article361ReviewGrounds:
# Newly discovered grounds
  label not_known definition newlyDiscoveredGroundExists under condition
    check.newlyDiscoveredGround = NewlyDiscoveredGround.SignificantCircumstancesNotKnown
    consequence equals Yes

  label false_evidence definition newlyDiscoveredGroundExists under condition
    check.newlyDiscoveredGround = NewlyDiscoveredGround.FalseEvidenceEstablished
    consequence equals Yes

  label cancelled_decision definition newlyDiscoveredGroundExists under condition
    check.newlyDiscoveredGround = NewlyDiscoveredGround.UnderlyingDecisionCancelled
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_newly_discovered definition newlyDiscoveredGroundExists equals No

# Exceptional grounds
  label unconstitutional definition exceptionalGroundExists under condition
    check.exceptionalGround = ExceptionalCircumstanceGround.UnconstitutionalityEstablished
    consequence equals Yes

  label judge_guilt definition exceptionalGroundExists under condition
    check.exceptionalGround = ExceptionalCircumstanceGround.JudgeCriminalGuilt
    consequence equals Yes

  label international definition exceptionalGroundExists under condition
    check.exceptionalGround = ExceptionalCircumstanceGround.InternationalCourtViolation
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_exceptional definition exceptionalGroundExists equals No

# Review ground exists when either newly discovered or exceptional
  label ground definition reviewGroundExists under condition
    newlyDiscoveredGroundExists = Yes
    or exceptionalGroundExists = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_ground definition reviewGroundExists equals No

# Review not allowed for re-evaluation of evidence
  label reevaluation definition reviewNotAllowed under condition
    check.isReevaluationOfEvidence = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label unexamined definition reviewNotAllowed under condition
    check.isUnexaminedEvidenceOfEstablishedFacts = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label new_law_not_ground definition reviewNotAllowed under condition
    check.newLawSoftensOrCancelsResponsibility = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label allowed definition reviewNotAllowed equals No
```

## Article 362. Right to apply for review

```catala
declaration scope Article362ReviewRight:
  input check content ReviewRightCheck
  output hasRightToRequestReview content YesNo

scope Article362ReviewRight:
# Case participants may request review
  label participant definition hasRightToRequestReview under condition
    check.isCaseParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Non-participant whose rights were decided may request review
  label nonparticipant definition hasRightToRequestReview under condition
    check.courtDecidedRightsOfNonParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_right definition hasRightToRequestReview equals No
```

## Article 363. Procedure and deadlines for review application

```catala
declaration scope Article363ReviewDeadlines:
  input deadline content ReviewDeadlineDetermination
  output applicationWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output absoluteDeadlineApplies content YesNo

scope Article363ReviewDeadlines:
# Newly discovered: significant circumstances - 30 days from discovery, max 3 years
  label significant_circumstances definition applicationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceDiscovery <= 30
    and deadline.yearsSinceDecisionFinal <= 3
    consequence equals Yes

# Newly discovered: false evidence - 30 days from verdict
  label false_evidence definition applicationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceVerdictFinal <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Newly discovered: underlying decision cancelled - 30 days from cancellation
  label cancelled definition applicationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceUnderlyingDecisionCancelled <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Exceptional: constitutional court - 30 days from publication
  label constitutional definition applicationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceConstitutionalCourtPublished <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Exceptional: judge guilt - 30 days from verdict
  label judge_verdict definition applicationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceJudgeVerdictFinal <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Exceptional: international court - 30 days from final status
  label international definition applicationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceInternationalCourtFinal <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

  label deadline_expired definition applicationWithinDeadline equals No

# Absolute deadlines: 3 years for significant circumstances, 10 years for others
  label three_year_absolute definition absoluteDeadlineApplies under condition
    deadline.yearsSinceDecisionFinal > 3
    and deadline.isInternationalCourtCase = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label ten_year_absolute definition absoluteDeadlineApplies under condition
    deadline.yearsSinceDecisionFinal > 10
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_absolute definition absoluteDeadlineApplies equals No
```

## Article 364. Form and content of review application

```catala
declaration scope Article364ReviewForm:
  input check content ReviewFormCheck
  output applicationMeetsFormRequirements content YesNo

scope Article364ReviewForm:
# Application must meet formal requirements
  label compliant definition applicationMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.complaintMeetsRequirements = Yes
    and check.evidenceAttached = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_compliant definition applicationMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.complaintMeetsRequirements = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_evidence definition applicationMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.evidenceAttached = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 365. Filing procedure for review application

```catala
declaration scope Article365ReviewFiling:
  input check content ReviewFilingCheck
  output filedWithCorrectCourt content YesNo

scope Article365ReviewFiling:
# First instance decision review filed with court that decided
  label first_instance definition filedWithCorrectCourt under condition
    check.reviewingFirstInstanceDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Appeal or cassation decision review filed with court that changed/adopted new decision
  label higher_instance definition filedWithCorrectCourt under condition
    check.reviewingAppealOrCassationDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# International court ground filed with Supreme Court Grand Chamber
  label international definition filedWithCorrectCourt under condition
    check.isInternationalCourtGround = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label wrong_court definition filedWithCorrectCourt equals No
```

## Article 366. Opening proceedings for review

```catala
declaration scope Article366ReviewOpening:
  input check content ReviewOpeningCheck
  output proceedingsOpened content YesNo
  output fiveDayDecisionDeadline content YesNo

scope Article366ReviewOpening:
# Open when requirements met and deadline not expired
  label open definition proceedingsOpened under condition
    check.complaintMeetsRequirements = Yes
    and check.deadlineExpiredWithoutRestoration = No
    and check.absoluteDeadlineExpired = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_opened_requirements definition proceedingsOpened under condition
    check.complaintMeetsRequirements = No
    consequence equals No

  label not_opened_deadline definition proceedingsOpened under condition
    check.deadlineExpiredWithoutRestoration = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label not_opened_absolute definition proceedingsOpened under condition
    check.absoluteDeadlineExpired = Yes
    consequence equals No

# Five day deadline
  label five_days definition fiveDayDecisionDeadline equals Yes
```

## Article 367. Withdrawal of review application and consequences

```catala
declaration scope Article367ReviewWithdrawal:
  input check content ReviewWithdrawalCheck
  output withdrawalAccepted content YesNo

scope Article367ReviewWithdrawal:
# Withdrawal accepted before hearing starts
  label accepted definition withdrawalAccepted under condition
    check.withdrawnBeforeHearing = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_accepted definition withdrawalAccepted equals No
```

## Article 368. Procedure for review

```catala
declaration scope Article368ReviewProcedure:
  input check content ReviewProceedingCheck
  output thirtyDayDeadline content YesNo
  output nonAppearanceNotPreclusive content YesNo

scope Article368ReviewProcedure:
# 30 day deadline from opening
  label thirty_days definition thirtyDayDeadline under condition
    check.daysSinceOpening <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded definition thirtyDayDeadline equals No

# Non-appearance of properly notified participants does not prevent review
  label non_preclusive definition nonAppearanceNotPreclusive equals Yes
```

## Article 369. Court decision following review proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article369ReviewDecision:
  input check content ReviewDecisionCheck
  output reviewOutcomeDecided content YesNo
  output newDecisionAppealable content YesNo

scope Article369ReviewDecision:
# Outcome decided based on review findings
  label decided definition reviewOutcomeDecided equals Yes

# New decision may be appealed according to rules for that instance
  label appealable definition newDecisionAppealable equals Yes
```
